ght at  the morgue here in the real world these  guys though Deckard pops his neck and  emerges without a scratch Dom climbs out  a little worse for wear but still fine  both cars are totaled masses of twisted  steel and these dudes are still ready  for fistfights for a giant hammer fights  in Dom's case somehow the second time  this happens manages to be just as if  not more shocking than the first doing  it once is one thing that's already  crazy but twice head-on doing 80 and Dom  can still swing around to comically  large wrenches we should have sent these  guys to fight Thanos The Fast and the  Furious was about an undercover cop  infiltrating illegal street racers who  sometimes boost VCRs and VCR TV combos  kids ask your parents what those are  more than 15 years and a blockbuster  franchise later the fate of the Furious  sees the same racers now recruited by a  secret agent who's saving the world from  a cyber terrorist threatening literal  nuclear annihilation  it's been a journey no moment  illustrates that better than submarine  racing across a Tundra to escape boards  of Russian soldiers the gang already has  the odds stacked against them then a  literal nuclear submarine explodes  upward from the frozen lake below  sending a few trucks or what's left of  them flying in all directions as it too  begins chasing the crew for a second  press pause and imagine you haven't seen  any of the movies since the first one  and now you're watching this moment do  you think this lady was really mad about  her VCRs check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite movies are  coming soon subscribe to our YouTube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

